  "content": "<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Hs7Mdzf7/banner.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"265\">\n<strong>📕 關於：</strong><br/>\n此模组是Farmer's Delight和Untamed Wilds的附加模组。<br/>\n<br/><strong>🍞 內容：</strong><ul><li>5个可放置的盛宴</li><li>2个效果</li><li>许多餐点和零食</li><li>特殊怪物掉落物而不是普通肉类</li></ul>\n<br/><strong>🥪 图片：</strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/wTSD8v7Y/showcase.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1009\" height=\"800\"> <img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/pTC1pH4X/showcase1-1.png\" alt=\"v1.1\" width=\"1011\" height=\"524\">\n<br/><strong>🔨&nbsp;所需依赖项：</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\">Farmer's Delight</a><br/><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/untamedwilds\">Untamed Wilds </a>&nbsp;(此模组需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/citadel\">Citadel</a>)<br/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Discord?<a href=\"https://discord.gg/fbFRfZtVf5\">这里</a></span>",
